<title>USA: Jury reaches verdict in Oklahoma City bombing.</title>
<headline>Jury reaches verdict in Oklahoma City bombing.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The jury in the Oklahoma City bombing trial has reached a verdict and will announce it at 3:30 p.m. EDT(1930 GMT), court officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>The jury reached a verdict on the fourth day of their deliberations on the fate of accused bomber Timothy McVeigh, who could face the death penalty if convicted of the April 19, 1995, blast.</p>
